+      "note": "The only release manifest describes the current release and is regenerated on each build; it does not designate an approved earlier recovery release. Its image and harness are pinned, but that alone supplies neither a recovery setup nor a rollback procedure. Enumerated all files under agent/ including hidden files and searched for rollback and recovery; inspected the manifest, README operating instructions, full CI workflow and deployment. No rollback script, pipeline or runbook exists in the supplied repo. This is a missing-control finding, not a claim that the current image uses a mutable tag."
+    },
