+      "id": "C07.2",
+      "result": "unclear",
+      "evidence": "agent/deploy/k8s/deployment.yaml:110, agent/app/identity.py:104",
+      "quote": "            secretName: procurement-slack-signing\n                    \"subject_token\": self._workload_token(),",
+      "note": "Runtime credentials use externally supplied Kubernetes secrets and workload-token exchange at an external STS. No rollback procedure or STS permission-management implementation is supplied, so the repo cannot establish whether recovery preserves revocations or restores old grants. The initial migration contains grants, but no evidence shows it is re-applied during rollback."
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "C07.3",
+      "result": "fails",
+      "evidence": "agent/release/manifest.yaml:89, agent/migrations/001_init.sql:91",
+      "quote": "  store: \"postgres procurement.dept_notes\"\nCREATE INDEX dept_notes_lookup ON dept_notes (business_unit, department, created_at DESC);",
+      "note": "Persistent memory and its database index exist, but no rollback procedure defines how to drain, migrate or discard this state. File enumeration and searches for rollback, recovery, checkpoint and queue found no recovery handling for memory, indexes, checkpoints or queued work. The existing halt control is not a state-recovery procedure. This finding establishes missing explicit handling, not observed replay of an unsafe side effect."
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "C07.4",
+      "result": "unclear",
+      "evidence": "agent/release/manifest.yaml:42, agent/release/manifest.yaml:54",
+      "quote": "    model_id: \"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929\"\n    model_id: \"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\"",
+      "note": "The current release names two hosted models and has no recorded retirement dates; a repository-wide retirement search found none. However, no recovery setup is identified, so its hosted-model list cannot be established and these current-release models cannot be assumed to be recovery models. Current provider availability cannot be verified from the supplied repo."
+    }
+  ],
+  "note": "C07 fails because the supplied repo lacks an approved recovery setup and rollback procedure with explicit state handling; recovery credential behavior and model retirement records remain unclear."
